          "message": {
            "text": "The source-owned partition proves the defect is missing itemization, not raster noise. Pinned Blink splits the 52-code-unit line at 43 and 44 around emoji-presentation U+2757; Domotion's current bidi/script item remains 0-52. The native arm64 route matrix then reproduces the order-sensitive FreeSans-versus-Noto ownership change while keeping VS15, VS16, CSS, and declared-family controls fixed.",
            "markdown": "The source-owned partition proves the defect is missing itemization, not raster noise. Pinned Blink splits the 52-code-unit line at 43 and 44 around emoji-presentation U+2757; Domotion's current bidi/script item remains 0-52. The native arm64 route matrix then reproduces the order-sensitive FreeSans-versus-Noto ownership change while keeping VS15, VS16, CSS, and declared-family controls fixed."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tools/emoji-presentation-ownership-audit.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 137,
                  "endLine": 154,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "export function structuralOwnershipEvidence(text = EMOJI_OWNERSHIP_FIXTURE): StructuralOwnershipEvidence {\n  const sourceItems = sourcePriorityItems(text);\n  const currentSegments = segmentForShaping(text, bidiLevelsFor(text));\n  const currentBoundaries = new Set(currentSegments.flatMap((segment) => [segment.start, segment.end]));\n  const missingSourceBoundaries = sourceItems\n    .flatMap((item) => [item.start, item.end])\n    .filter((boundary, index, all) => boundary > 0 && boundary < text.length\n      && all.indexOf(boundary) === index && !currentBoundaries.has(boundary));\n  const target = text.indexOf(EMOJI_OWNERSHIP_TARGET);\n  const targetItem = sourceItems.find((item) => item.start === target);\n  return {\n    sourcePriorityItems: sourceItems,\n    currentSegments,\n    missingSourceBoundaries,\n    rootCausePresent: targetItem?.priority === \"emoji\"\n      && missingSourceBoundaries.includes(target)\n      && missingSourceBoundaries.includes(target + EMOJI_OWNERSHIP_TARGET.length),\n  };"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
